<title>MOROCCO: World Bank grants Morocco $23 million.</title>
<headline>World Bank grants Morocco $23 million.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank has granted Morocco a credit of $23 million to help improve professional training, the official news agency MAP said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said the credit, available in several instalments, was granted on Thursday in Washington. It gave no other details.</p>
